<TXT>Within the chemical composition limits set forth above, wrought aluminum alloys must conform to the following:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Extruded bars, rods, shapes and tubes: <MET> <RID>ASTM B221M</RID></MET><ENG> <RID>ASTM B221</RID></ENG> and <RID>ASTM B308/B308M</RID> and <RID>ASTM B429/B429M</RID>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Sheet and Plate: <MET> <RID>ASTM B209M</RID></MET><ENG> <RID>ASTM B209</RID></ENG>.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Cast Aluminum Alloys</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide those in which the alloying elements are silicon, magnesium, manganese, or a combination of these.  Other elements must not exceed the 
following limits:</TXT><BRK/>
<TAB WIDTH="50">
<WBK>
   <STS/>
   <TDA COLUMNCOUNT="2" ROWCOUNT="6">
