face.  Apply coating of [epoxy] [polyester] [_____] followed by application of [inert aggregate] [_____] to exposed face in the [factory] 
[field].  [Inert aggregate] [_____] must be [natural stone chips] [crushed marble] [_____] [with minimum and maximum sizes of [_____] and 
[_____]].  Color of [_____] must be [_____].</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Nonmetallic panels, [_____] surfaced:  [_____] [tempered hardboard] [_____] board base with applied [factory] [or] [field] finish of [[_____] 
resins and decorative natural stone chips] [_____]. Apply [epoxy] [polyester] coating of [_____] followed by application of [inert aggregate] 
[_____] to exposed face in the [factory] [field].  [Inert aggregate] [_____] must be [natural stone chips] [crushed marble] [_____] [with 
minimum and maximum sizes  of [_____] and [_____]].  Color of [_____] must be [_____].</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT><SPT><TTL>Metal Windows</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
