[_____] type.  [Operating windows must be complete with hardware, weatherstripping, and accessories.]  Hardware must comply with [<RID>AAMA/WDMA/CSA 101/I.S.2/A440</RID>
] [<RID>SWI AGSW</RID>] modified as follows:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Metal and finish for hardware must be [_____].</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>[_____].</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
